                     <title key="">sangs rgyas bcom ldan 'das kyi mtshan brgya rtsa brgyad pa gzungs sngags dang bcas pa sogs mtshan brgya'i rigs bzhugs//</title>
                     <title type="margin" xml:lang="bo">མཚན</title>
                     <title type="margin">mtshan</title>
                     <incipit xml:lang="bo">sangs rgyas bcom ldan 'das kyi mtshan brgya rtsa brgyad pa gzungs sngags dang bcas pa / thams cad mkhyen pa la phyag 'tshal lo / bcom ldan 'das snying rje'i tsan dan dri zhim po'i spos kyis byugs pa'i sku / zhabs pad+ma lha dang lha ma yin gyi nor bu'i cod pan gyis gtugs pa / rang byung sel mdzad / bla ma / 'jig rten thams cad la phan mdzad pa/ ston pa/ de bzhin gshegs pa/ thub pa/ nyes pa dang bral ba/ zhi ba'i bdag nyid can/ gzugs mdzes pa/ mtshan gsal ba'i gzi brjid can/ sku dpe byad kyis brgyan pa/ yon tan thams cad yang dag par rdzogs pa'i sangs rgyas la phyag 'tshal lo/</incipit>
                     <explicit xml:lang="bo">/ming brgya rtsa brgyad dam pa 'di/ /bsam pa kun dang 'byor pa yi/ /gnas mchog bla na med pa ste/ / dpal yon rgya chen sbyin pa yin / / yid ni shin tu dang ba yis / / sa yi snying po'i mtshan gsal ba/ / 'dod pa thams cad rab sg+AC13rub ba'i/ / yon tan mchog ni gang brjod dang / /dpal yon rgya chen 'dzin pa yi/ /ming brgya rtsa brgyad dam pa 'di/ /mi ni gang zhig rjod byed pa/ /sdug bsngal kun las myur du 'grol/ /'phags pa sa'i snying po'i mtshan brgya rtsa brgyad pa gzungs sngags dang bcas pa rdzogs so// gcig zhu/ bkra shis/</explicit>
